Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:24:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] backup: accept the backup transport role holder

TransportManager currently only trusts transports that are on the system
whitelist and privileged. Accept the current holder of
android.app.role.BACKUP_TRANSPORT as well, keeping the whitelist path for
OEM transports.

Bug: 0
Test: m framework-minus-apex
Change-Id: Idefcdebbc4173c308f71ffc4410e65556c9b9547
